{"id":60,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>近日，由教育部、人民日报社共同指导，人民网、光明日报教育体育部、《大学生》杂志和中国大学生在线联合主办的第十八届“大学生年度人物”推选展示活动评选结果公示结束，共遴选年度人物20名，年度人物提名奖30名，年度人物入围奖147名。我校学子靳昊宇同学荣获“第十八届全国大学生年度人物”入围奖。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=UU8Ln8LR-YL49DMSRA2n7LDozGZUzNz8nm-iMzL8oRT2MRU0gihFp2hmCIa0Mky8okh7L1hVMR9DnRARLRAVnlLZnlLsU49PMm-iUlr7nNQFL8M2LRWVUznFL4LPLkb/v2veo4Oe_dM1gDTJQty0LzGaoSy4Mz74gtA8pUlcc&oid=1852125069&tid=1009&nid=3513&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/448D2E486D8C08EEC8EC7C81625AEDFF/3CF02EA4/3310\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"295\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=UU8Ln8LR-YL49DMSRA2n7LDozGZUzNz8nm-iMzL8oRT2MRU0gihFp2hmCIa0Mky8okh7L1hVMR9DnRARLRAVnlLZnlLsU49PMm-iUlr7nNQFL8M2LRWVUznFL4LPLkb/v2veo4Oe_dM1gDTJQty0LzGaoSy4Mz74gtA8pUlcc&oid=1852125069&tid=1009&nid=3513&e=.jpg\"></p><p>靳昊宇同学是我校仪器与电子学院2021级学术硕士研究生，学习成绩优异，同级专业排名第一，曾获硕士国家奖学金、学业特等奖学金、学业一等奖学金、综合一等奖学金。个人荣誉方面，获三好学生标兵、优秀共青团员、优秀共青团干部、优秀志愿者等称号。硕士研究生期间，进入郝晓剑教授“中仪迅辉”大学生科技创新团队后，围绕极端复杂环境下的光电探测技术前沿展开研究，以第一作者发表SCI/EI学术论文3篇，其中一篇被选为光谱学1区top期刊封面文章。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=ULz-naUlliU8lDUSlC8U8nkLNVVM4nzkL4CYMz-iL47PUmC0gihFp2hmCIa0UYyin1y8MSyYLl7ZUmnkLznVnlM2Um-PnzQVnzn2U8L4LRfFnRW7M87ZoRAFLlLiLRNJv2bjo4OeosA4C1hXptQ0g47aLRN0L4lPLYbw62l8c&oid=1852125069&tid=1009&nid=3513&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/C5F4521A8B4B14EECFB21E6EE4FCC300/D2D7A888/1C509\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=UMmWnRolQ2LRrfnS7-iMR-iozTkUzrz2M8rfnNl8UlMfMzl0gihFp2hmCIa0Mky4USybLkhRnRn2L4NbLRr7nz7YnzvDMmLanzUPMm9DUm6FLlUDU4l8MRWFLzrfnNQVUSbaptveo4Oe_dM1gDTJQty0LzGaoSy4Mz74gtA8pUlcc&oid=1852125069&tid=1009&nid=3513&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=UMmWnfollPU4l4LSzNanmlan7UsM49zYnRVVolCPU4UDLNC0gihFp2hmCIa0MYh7Lky8M1y4nmCZoRUPUmlbnzf2olMRMmGiL4GsLzMRnRrFM4UYnRW7M8MFnlVVL1b/v2veo4Oe_dM1gDTJQty0LzGaoSy4Mz74gtA8pUlcc&oid=1852125069&tid=1009&nid=3513&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/7D0463F68841B59E0F9CC60530713CD5/742D2D7C/EAE2\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=UM4nnRL778Um6RUSzV2UmlaM7rfnllzanz7aM8lbL7L4M8l0gihFp2hmCIa0U1hfLSyYUYyYL7WfoR-YLRA7nzT2U4rVMzQVnRCiUzQRMzQFnmliMNWVL46FMmf7MlCZgtXaQ4Oeo4xZvD-0qIbtpYyPLRGbg4LiLzLJqdlnx&oid=1852125069&tid=1009&nid=3513&e=.jpg\"></p><p>&nbsp;<br /></p><p>在学科竞赛方面，靳昊宇同学以团队带头人获中国研究生“双碳”创新创意大赛全国一等奖；中国研究生电子设计大赛全国三等奖、华北赛区一等奖；“互联网+”大学生创新创业大赛山西省银奖、“互联网+”大学生创新创业大赛山西省金奖、“挑战杯”大学生创新创业大赛山西省银奖等奖项。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=UnzWnkn7C4nNLaMS4LsnllPMmn2ol-z8oRNbnNQfMzl8Mz90gihFp2hmCIa0UYhkLYyPoShVLR6RM7-DnRfRMmT2Mm6VL8UaL8L4MmNZoRWFoR7aMzUZnNrFLlWfU4NJqjfjo4OeosA4C1hXptQ0g47aLRN0L4lPLYbw62l8c&oid=1852125069&tid=1009&nid=3513&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/CB319E07C4B6D0C69F67E3D03C369882/810548FE/1BAC9\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=UMR6nRnz9ZolrfMSN-Pnz62L4WRMR9ziM4G8MRVVM4QkMR-0gihFp2hmCIa0LkysU1yaoShRL4GYU4r2Uzr7M4CDUl7iozGiLz98LNCYLlrFLz-bL4UanzMFMRAfU4-ZgtXaQ4Oeo4xZvD-0qIbtpYyPLRGbg4LiLzLJqdlnx&oid=1852125069&tid=1009&nid=3513&e=.jpg\"></p><p>&nbsp;<br /></p><p>靳昊宇同学课余时间积极投身服务社会的志愿服务中，9年累积服务时长达2600小时。在家乡非盈利公益组织“汾阳正能量联合会”中担任团支书。幼有所教，他倡导为偏远山区儿童搭建的“梦想启航&middot;公益助学”资助平台，通过访百校、寻千家、走万户，累计为82名寒门学子送去24.8万余元的学费资助。老有所养，连续5年为杨家庄和后庄化两所敬老院近百名孤寡老人夏送清凉、冬送温暖。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=UUlnn2L8-Yo7r7USzCaMR9Yo7WkUmvzZnNMRolW7nzTRM8U0gihFp2hmCIa0okybMSyDUShRM4AkozlYoRr7nmv4nRGZM7L8MmG8L4CaLRAFL7CsLm6VUNVFLznVU4LJqjfjo4OeosA4C1hXptQ0g47aLRN0L4lPLYbw62l8c&oid=1852125069&tid=1009&nid=3513&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/8956AC78B95285DF73D084C460436008/0F727EBA/14EC3\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=UUm7n8UzrfnRV2nS7QRnN-snmV2nzNzPLz6kozVRLR9ZLm-0gihFp2hmCIa0L1yPUSyiLYh7UzQ2Lll4nNQkLRCbozfkLmCPnmT7L8UYUlMFU49Po77ZnmrFo7l4MNUDgtXaQ4Oeo4xZvD-0qIbtpYyPLRGbg4LiLzLJqdlnx&oid=1852125069&tid=1009&nid=3513&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=UUNWnfnRGinNMRnS7UsL467L8L4MRvzZnmQ2LmC4oRLboRl0gihFp2hmCIa0UYhVnkh2nkyYnRAkLmNPMzL4LmUDL4LDUm9bL4NaMRUiozVFol-aMR62nNVFnNLDMSb/v2veo4Oe_dM1gDTJQty0LzGaoSy4Mz74gtA8pUlcc&oid=1852125069&tid=1009&nid=3513&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/CEDFD2D8B291533246336B8939044591/9B047FFA/FC65\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=UnzMn7n7VkUNV7USlCsM7LaL4r2MR6z2LN-DnmLYL4vPMmU0gihFp2hmCIa0LShfn1yZokhfM4l4nRG8Lml8Uz-YnzvsoRv4ozNPo7Q2M8VFMmCaLRL8UzQFo7l8MzfkgtXaQ4Oeo4xZvD-0qIbtpYyPLRGbg4LiLzLJqdlnx&oid=1852125069&tid=1009&nid=3513&e=.jpg\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>“大学生年度人物”推选展示活动旨在深入学习贯彻习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想和党的二十大精神，充分展示高校大学生坚定不移听党话、跟党走，怀抱梦想又脚踏实地的青春风貌，激励广大青年学生立志做有理想、敢担当、能吃苦、肯奋斗的新时代好青年。多年来，我校学生工作在校院两级共同努力下，始终坚持以学生发展为中心，落实立德树人根本任务，深入实施“时代新人铸魂工程”,在“三全育人”中增效赋能，在“五育并举”中凝心聚魂，培养了一大批优秀学生。据悉，我校已经连续两年获此殊荣，此前半导体与物理学院仪器科学与技术专业2021级博士研究生贾涛同学荣获“第十七届全国大学生年度人物”入围奖，充分展示出我校学子开拓创新、积极进取的精神风貌。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=UUzUnDnznfLR94USlUbLNCaLl-aU8VzkL4MVUzCZLm6koRG0gihFp2hmCIa0Mkh7LYhRUSyDU8lYozTVUm-Znz6kMm9sU4nkozQVMRV2nRTFollaMlWfnzfFnN-sM7lJqjfjo4OeosA4C1hXptQ0g47aLRN0L4lPLYbw62l8c&oid=1852125069&tid=1009&nid=3513&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/4D3CA6CE299EB28E7B687C4B96E41FD9/9E05BAE0/FB74E\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=UUzUnDnznfLR94USlUbLNCaLl-aU8VzkL4MVUzCZLm6koRG0gihFp2hmCIa0Mkh7LYhRUSyDU8lYozTVUm-Znz6kMm9sU4nkozQVMRV2nRTFollaMlWfnzfFnN-sM7lJqjfjo4OeosA4C1hXptQ0g47aLRN0L4lPLYbw62l8c&oid=1852125069&tid=1009&nid=3513&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=ULzLnbnzUZnmnfMSmUZMz-soRVRMzLzaozC8M4rkMzNaMzU0gihFp2hmCIa0MSyDokyDMYh2L8lZL4UaL8LaUzQ2MRQkUmC8UmviMRARn7MFLRrVU4M7MRTFLmW7LmGJqjfjo4OeosA4C1hXptQ0g47aLRN0L4lPLYbw62l8c&oid=1852125069&tid=1009&nid=3513&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/56867F3E83403C0A6F46BB64B7548CDC/05EC3D49/22D20\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Uolnn7n7LPLRNiLS47aUmCsMNVkMl7zZMNVfUzV2MRr2U4N0gihFp2hmCIa0MYhfU1hfLkhRM77inRUZnl7sUmNYMNUaMmMRnRNPnm-aMRnFLNnkn7n2nRWFMm9boz98gtXaQ4Oeo4xZvD-0qIbtpYyPLRGbg4LiLzLJqdlnx&oid=1852125069&tid=1009&nid=3513&e=.jpg\"></p><p>今后，我们将持续做好学生教育管理服务工作，推动学生工作高质量发展，为学校提升人才培养质量、加快“双一流”大学创建贡献力量!</p><p><br /></p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"https://xsgzb.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=UU8Ln8LR-YL49DMSRA2n7LDozGZUzNz8nm-iMzL8oRT2MRU0gihFp2hmCIa0Mky8okh7L1hVMR9DnRARLRAVnlLZnlLsU49PMm-iUlr7nNQFL8M2LRWVUznFL4LPLkb/v2veo4Oe_dM1gDTJQty0LzGaoSy4Mz74gtA8pUlcc&oid=1852125069&tid=1009&nid=3513&e=.jpg"}